config SND_FLYER
	tristate "MOTU PC-MIDI Flyer on a parallel port"
	depends on HAS_IOPORT
	select SND_RAWMIDI
	help
	  To use a MOTU PC-MIDI Flyer connected to the parallel port, say
	  Y here and keep the port's own driver off it: this takes the
	  port itself. Its two inputs and two outputs appear as one
	  rawmidi device.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called snd-flyer.
